{
  "about": "Shared cases for the point cloud cleanup evaluators (aio.pccleanup/1): packages/pointcloud/src/cleanup/evaluate.test.ts and python/tests/test_pccleanup_evaluate.py. States: kept, hidden, classHidden, deleted, dropped (precedence dropped > deleted > classHidden > hidden > kept). Rules pinned here: boundaries are inclusive (a point exactly on a clip box face, or at height min or max, is inside); hide and delete marks accumulate and delete is sticky whatever the region order; a class set is won by the last region; w must be above 0 (P6 and P9 sit at w = 0 in the perspective case). P6 to P9 lie exactly on a box face or a height bound; no point lies on a polygon edge.",
